    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tap with Ease, Keep the Beat!</i><br><i>Wacky Themes, Endless Fun!</i><br><i>BackSlap</i> is a 1K quirky rhythm idle game featuring hilarious themes like spa massages, panda karaoke, and otter clam-smashing, delivering a lighthearted and joyful gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bFun Themes, Massive Music Library\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Themes\u200b</strong>\u200b: Unlock absurd scenarios\u2014spa massages, panda karaoke, otter clam-smashing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bHuge Song Collection\u200b</strong>\u200b: Each theme comes with unique tracks and skins\u201490 songs to keep you hooked!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bSimple Taps, One-Key Hide\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bSingle-Key Play\u200b</strong>\u200b: Easy 1-track gameplay\u2014use your keyboard or mouse to tap along!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bAdjustable Difficulty\u200b</strong>\u200b: Choose <i>Gentle Tap</i> (casual) or <i>Hard Smack</i> (hardcore) modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBoss Key\u200b</strong>\u200b: Customize a one-key hide feature for seamless &quot;work mode&quot; camouflage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bIdle &amp; Level Up\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bProgress Unlocks\u200b</strong>\u200b: Gain EXP by tapping\u2014unlock new themes effortlessly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bAFK Listening\u200b</strong>\u200b: Earn EXP while idle with background music\u2014level up while you chill!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bChallenge &amp; Compete\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLeaderboards\u200b</strong>\u200b: Check your ranking after completing songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDaily Challenges\u200b</strong>\u200b: Random daily trials\u2014aim for the high score!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Beatmaps, Easy Import\u200b</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Import Your Own:\u00a0</strong>Supports osu!mania beatmaps\u2014just drop your .osz and start playing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <i>BackSlap</i> and start your whimsical rhythm adventure today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tap with Ease, Keep the Beat!</i><br><i>Wacky Themes, Endless Fun!</i><br><i>BackSlap</i> is a 1K quirky rhythm idle game featuring hilarious themes like spa massages, panda karaoke, and otter clam-smashing, delivering a lighthearted and joyful gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bFun Themes, Massive Music Library\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Themes\u200b</strong>\u200b: Unlock absurd scenarios\u2014spa massages, panda karaoke, otter clam-smashing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bHuge Song Collection\u200b</strong>\u200b: Each theme comes with unique tracks and skins\u201490 songs to keep you hooked!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bSimple Taps, One-Key Hide\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bSingle-Key Play\u200b</strong>\u200b: Easy 1-track gameplay\u2014use your keyboard or mouse to tap along!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bAdjustable Difficulty\u200b</strong>\u200b: Choose <i>Gentle Tap</i> (casual) or <i>Hard Smack</i> (hardcore) modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBoss Key\u200b</strong>\u200b: Customize a one-key hide feature for seamless &quot;work mode&quot; camouflage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bIdle &amp; Level Up\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bProgress Unlocks\u200b</strong>\u200b: Gain EXP by tapping\u2014unlock new themes effortlessly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bAFK Listening\u200b</strong>\u200b: Earn EXP while idle with background music\u2014level up while you chill!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bChallenge &amp; Compete\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLeaderboards\u200b</strong>\u200b: Check your ranking after completing songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDaily Challenges\u200b</strong>\u200b: Random daily trials\u2014aim for the high score!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Beatmaps, Easy Import\u200b</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Import Your Own:\u00a0</strong>Supports osu!mania beatmaps\u2014just drop your .osz and start playing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <i>BackSlap</i> and start your whimsical rhythm adventure today!</p>",
